# @__SCOPE__/__name__

A shared package of this workspace for code that two or more apps need. Runtime: `__runtime__`. Its public
API is `src/index.ts`, compiled to `dist/`; apps and other packages import only `@__SCOPE__/__name__`.

- Tags: `type:package`, `scope:shared` and `runtime:__runtime__`. Lint refuses an import of an app from
  this package and a dependency that crosses a runtime tag.
- An app uses it by adding `"@__SCOPE__/__name__": "workspace:*"` to the dependencies of its
  `package.json` and running `pnpm install`; the app build then builds this package first.
- Targets: `build`, `typecheck`, `format`, `format:check`, `lint` and `test`.
